# Season 2 Phase Three

Twenty games and two phases of the campaign down! The [Phase Two](/archive/recaps/s2-phase-two) page has been finalized with 8 games played over two game days.  The story for phase two was absolutely dominant play by the Raiders faction who went undefeated - in [Phase Three](/archive/recaps/s2-phase-three) it looks to be a close match with Attackers at 29 and Raiders at 20.  Although the Defenders only have 7, three big wins could put them back in contention.

Strategic Value Campaign:

Attackers: 1

Raiders: 2

Defenders: 0

![](https://ik.imagekit.io/carolinafirstandonly/seasons/season-2/image-2.jpg)

