    src="https://ik.imagekit.io/carolinafirstandonly/events/showdown-at-snyders/round-two-belakor-1.jpg"
    alt="Be'lakor advances into the Eldar lines."
  />
  <figcaption>Be'lakor advances into the Eldar lines.</figcaption>
</figure>

<figure>
  <img
    src="https://ik.imagekit.io/carolinafirstandonly/events/showdown-at-snyders/round-two-belakor-2.jpg"
    alt="Be'lakor in the thick of the Dire Avengers and Striking Scorpions."
  />
  <figcaption>Be'lakor in the thick of the Dire Avengers and Striking Scorpions.</figcaption>
</figure>

<figure>
  <img
    src="https://ik.imagekit.io/carolinafirstandonly/events/showdown-at-snyders/round-two-belakor-3.jpg"
    alt="Be'lakor falls to massed Eldar attacks after taking six wounds from a Leman Russ."
  />
  <figcaption>Be'lakor falls to massed Eldar attacks after taking six wounds from a Leman Russ.</figcaption>
